<title>GERMANY: MOTOCROSS-GERMAN 500CC GRAND PRIX RESULTS.</title>
<headline>MOTOCROSS-GERMAN 500CC GRAND PRIX RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>GAILDORF, Germany 1996-09-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading results in</p>
<p>Sunday's German 500cc motocross grand prix, final round of the</p>
<p>world championship:</p>
<p>First race</p>
<p>1. Pit Beirer (Germany) Honda</p>
<p>2. Joel Smets (Belgium) Husaberg</p>
<p>3. Darryll King (New Zealand) Honda</p>
<p>4. Peter Johansson (Sweden) Husqvarna</p>
<p>5. Shayne King (New Zealand) KTM</p>
<p>6. Dietmar Lacher (Germany) Honda</p>
<p>Second race</p>
<p>1. Bernd Eckenbach (Germany) Kawasaki</p>
<p>2. Johansson</p>
<p>3. Darryll King</p>
<p>4. Lacher</p>
<p>5. Smets</p>
<p>6. Shayne King</p>
<p>Overall on day:</p>
<p> 1. Johansson		 30 points</p>
<p> 2. Darryll King	    30</p>
<p> 3. Smets		     28</p>
<p> 4. Lacher		    23</p>
<p> 5. Shayne King	     21</p>
<p> 6. Eckenbach		 20</p>
<p>Final world championship standings:</p>
<p> 1. Shayne King	    344</p>
<p> 2. Smets		    318</p>
<p> 3. Johansson		266</p>
<p> 4. Lacher		   242</p>
<p> 5. Darryll King	   208</p>
<p> 6. Gert Jan Van Doorn (Netherlands) Honda 188</p>
